{"obs_mpqmm4qa_05f08c5c4279":{"observation":{"concepts":["waimai-cli","pagination","search query"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["User asked whether the waimai-cli search query has pagination functionality.","The question references the 'waimai-cli' tool's search feature."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpqmm4qa_05f08c5c4279","importance":3,"narrative":"The user is inquiring about the presence of pagination in the search query of the waimai-cli tool. This suggests they may be working with that tool and need to navigate through search results. The answer will determine next steps for providing usage guidance.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"Querying if waimai-cli search has page navigation","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:33.175Z","title":"User asks about pagination in waimai-cli search","type":"conversation"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpqmmapj_f5ca029017d0":{"observation":{"concepts":["cursor-based pagination","CLI response handling","TypeScript interfaces","pagination interface"],"confidence":1,"facts":["WaimaiClient class in packages/waimai-cli/src/client.ts:63 has private fields: _mtgsig, _agentSign, _refreshSessionEachRequest, _context for location and city IDs.","Pagination interface in daocan-cli/src/response.ts:26: cursor? (string), has_more (boolean), total? (number), page_size? (number).","Pagination interface in hotel-cli/src/response.ts:100: cursor? (string), has_more (boolean), total? (number), page_size (required number).","ok function in daocan-cli/src/response.ts:154 outputs JSON with status, data, optional pagination, trace_ids, metadata; logs and flushes.","buildPagination function in daocan-cli/src/response.ts:261 creates Pagination from offset, limit, and optional total.","daocan-cli and hotel-cli both define Pagination interfaces with minor differences (page_size optional vs required)."],"files":["packages/waimai-cli/src/client.ts","packages/daocan-cli/src/response.ts","packages/hotel-cli/src/response.ts"],"id":"obs_mpqmmapj_f5ca029017d0","importance":7,"narrative":"The agent queried the codegraph for context on waimai-cli search pagination. The response revealed the Pagination interfaces used across daocan-cli and hotel-cli, along with the WaimaiClient class definition and utility functions like ok and buildPagination in daocan-cli. This provides a clear baseline for implementing consistent pagination in waimai-cli.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"Query returned Pagination interfaces and WaimaiClient class","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:40.926Z","title":"Codegraph context: waimai-cli search pagination","type":"search"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpqmmdkn_b1b4f45ec25a":{"observation":{"concepts":["waimai search","pagination","form-urlencoded request","TypeScript client","diagnostic logging"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Exploration found symbols: buildPagination, Pagination, OkOptions, ok, buildComboItems, WaimaiClient, search, etc.","searchPois method accepts keyword, page (defaults to 0), page_size (defaults to 10), sort_type","Pagination uses page_index and page_size form fields; page_index 0-based","Request is POST to ENDPOINTS.SEARCH_GLOBAL with form-urlencoded body","Method includes diagnostic logging (searchDiagLog) showing curl command","Method calls maybeRefreshSessionBeforeRequest() before building request","Form fields include uid, search_global_id (timestamp), device_level, appid, etc.","Uses buildWmUrl and getWmAuthHeaders for URL and auth headers"],"files":["packages/waimai-cli/src/client.ts"],"id":"obs_mpqmmdkn_b1b4f45ec25a","importance":6,"narrative":"The codegraph exploration mapped pagination and search symbols across the codebase, exposing the searchPois method's implementation. The method implements pagination via page_index and page_size parameters, sends form-urlencoded POST requests with extensive additional fields, and includes detailed request logging. This is essential for understanding how the waimai search client constructs and executes search queries.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"Found 159 symbols across 52 files; key method searchPois in packages/waimai-cli/src/client.ts","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:44.641Z","title":"Code exploration: searchPois pagination symbols","type":"search"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpqmmil0_b738a9fb88ab":{"observation":{"concepts":["pagination pattern","code search","response utility functions"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Found `findModule` in packages/daocan-cli/scripts/review-write-render.ts","Found `parsePageQueryStr` in packages/daocan-cli/src/maiton-request.ts and maiton-response.ts","Found `buildPagination` in packages/hotel-cli/src/response.ts, packages/minsu-beam/src/response.ts, packages/payment-beam/src/response.ts","Found `build_pagination` in four archived Python skills: daocan-dingzuo-beam, daocan-recommend-beam, daocan-tuangou-beam, xiuxianwanle-beam","All pagination builders use `(offset, pageSize, total)` or `(offset, page_size, total)` pattern"],"files":["packages/daocan-cli/scripts/review-write-render.ts","packages/daocan-cli/src/maiton-request.ts","packages/daocan-cli/src/maiton-response.ts","packages/hotel-cli/src/response.ts","packages/minsu-beam/src/response.ts","packages/payment-beam/src/response.ts","skills/Archived/daocan-dingzuo-beam/src/response.py","skills/Archived/daocan-recommend-beam/src/response.py","skills/Archived/daocan-tuangou-beam/src/response.py","skills/Archived/xiuxianwanle-beam/src/response.py"],"id":"obs_mpqmmil0_b738a9fb88ab","importance":5,"narrative":"The search for pagination-related functions (searchPois page page_index) returned 10 results showing a consistent pattern across both TypeScript and Python packages. Multiple implementations of `buildPagination`/`build_pagination` exist, all using offset and pageSize parameters to construct pagination objects. This suggests a standard pagination approach across the codebase.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"10 results across multiple packages","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:51.133Z","title":"Codegraph search for pagination functions","type":"search"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpqmmld9_b2d42eaa4938":{"observation":{"concepts":["code dependency exploration","search API client architecture","JSON-RPC over HTTP","data class mapping (PoiInfo, SpuInfo)"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The exploration query targeted \"waimai-cli scripts search searchPois cli.ts search_command\"","Analysis discovered 160 symbols across 38 files with extensive call and instantiation relationships","Key call chain: quick_search ‚Üí search ‚Üí _parse_result/get; search also calls strip and _parse_response","Search method instantiates FridaySearchResponse and FridaySearchResult; _parse_result instantiates SpuInfo and PoiInfo","The file `skills/search_tool-beam/scripts/agent_search.py` contains DpShopSearch and BeamSearch classes","DpShopSearch.__init__ uses URL \"https://i-beam.sankuai.com/mcp-api/tools/call\" and Authorization header with a token (not shown)","DpShopSearch.search method sends POST with jsonrpc payload including \"dpShopSearch\" tool, query, cityId, topK, sortId, and commonParams"],"files":["skills/search_tool-beam/scripts/agent_search.py"],"id":"obs_mpqmmld9_b2d42eaa4938","importance":5,"narrative":"This codegraph exploration mapped the dependencies of the waimai-cli search functionality, revealing a layered architecture where higher-level search functions (like quick_search) delegate to a core search method that handles API calls and response parsing. The main file `agent_search.py` includes DpShopSearch, a client for the \"Âà∞È§êÂ∫óÈì∫ÊêúÁ¥¢\" (dine-in shop search) MCP API, along with BeamSearch. This exploration provides a structural overview useful for understanding or refactoring the search pipeline.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"Found 160 symbols across 38 files; architecture of search tools revealed","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:54.742Z","title":"Codegraph exploration of waimai-cli search functions","type":"search"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpqmmp7a_d889b36c030a":{"observation":{"concepts":["CLI script","WaimaiClient","POI search","diagnostic logging","coordinate conversion"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script located at /Users/wangshujun/workspace/beam-biz-skills-ca/packages/waimai-cli/scripts/search-query.ts","Usage: npx tsx scripts/search-query.ts --keyword --latitude --longitude --city-id [--page] [--sort-type] [--help]","Imports: WaimaiClient, parseArgs, error/ok, requireParam/optionalParam, handleHelp, searchDiagLog, extractBusinessStatusFromSearchPayload","Defines toCoordInt() to convert coordinate values to x1e6 integer strings","Command schema defines parameters: keyword (required), latitude (required), longitude (required), city-id (required), page (optional, default 0), sort-type (optional, default 0)","Main function creates WaimaiClient, sets context with lat/lng/cityId, calls client.searchPois","Handles response error by returning error() with code and msg","Iterates over response.data.module_list for diagnostic logging: logs response top keys, each module's string_data/data types and previews","Uses searchDiagLog for diagnostic logging (label: 'res' and per-module)"],"files":["/Users/wangshujun/workspace/beam-biz-skills-ca/packages/waimai-cli/scripts/search-query.ts"],"id":"obs_mpqmmp7a_d889b36c030a","importance":3,"narrative":"This file defines a CLI script that searches for merchants (POIs) using the WaimaiClient. It accepts keyword, latitude, longitude, city-id, and optional page/sort-type parameters, converts coordinate values, and calls searchPois. The response is validated, and diagnostic logging is performed on the module_list structure to inspect response fields.","sessionId":"cb11029f-d52f-4673-842c-064227ab778a","subtitle":"Read full content of search-query.ts","timestamp":"2026-05-29T07:54:59.712Z","title":"Search query CLI script for merchants","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"}}␀␀␀